id: 18
hanzi: 得到
pinyin: dé dào
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Verb

meanings_summary:
  en: to obtain; to receive; to gain; to achieve; to win
  es: obtener; conseguir; recibir; alcanzar; ganar

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Verb | Standard | to acquire, receive, or gain something concrete (rewards, salary) or abstract (support, recognition) | obtener; conseguir; recibir algo material o abstracto | 得到认可 (receive recognition)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 经过长达数月的艰苦努力，他的创新方案终于得到了行业专家的一致认可与高度赞赏。 | Jīngguò chángdá shù yuè de jiānkǔ nǔlì, tā de chuàngxīn fāng'àn zhōngyú dédào le hángyè zhuānjiā de yízhì rènkě yǔ gāodù zànyǎng. | After months of arduous effort, his innovative proposal finally received unanimous recognition and high praise from industry experts. | Tras meses de arduo empeño, su propuesta innovadora obtuvo por fin el reconocimiento unánime y los más altos elogios de los expertos del sector.
  #2 | 在现代法治社会中，每一位公民的合法权益都应当依法得到切实有效的保护。 | Zài xiàndài fǎzhì shèhuì zhōng, měi yí wèi gōngmín de héfǎ quányì dōu yīngdāng yīfǎ dédào qièshí yǒuxiào de bǎohù. | In a modern society governed by law, the lawful rights and interests of every citizen should be effectively protected according to law. | En un Estado de derecho moderno, los derechos e intereses legítimos de cada ciudadano deben ser protegidos de forma eficaz conforme a la ley.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  得到认可 | gain recognition
  得到支持 | receive support
  得到满足 | be satisfied / fulfilled
  得到改善 | achieve improvement
  得到解决 | be resolved
  得到证实 | be confirmed / verified

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  得心应手 | dé xīn yìng shǒu | handy and proficient; what the heart wishes the hand can do
  求之不得 | qiú zhī bù dé | all that one could wish for; sought after in vain
  得道多助 | dé dào duō zhù | a just cause attracts abundant support
  安居乐业 | ān jū lè yè | live and work in peace and contentment

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  得 | dé | obtain; gain; acquire | obtener; conseguir; adquirir | 彳 | step / walk | 彳 (footsteps along a road) | 㝵 (dé / hand grasping a shell currency) | 11 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound: 彳 (walking on a path) + 寸 (hand) grasping 贝 (cowrie shell money), meaning finding or acquiring treasure. | A hand (寸) reaching out on the road (彳) to grasp valuable wealth. | Una mano (寸) que en su camino (彳) alcanza a tomar un tesoro valioso. | 35 | HOAMI | ""
  到 | dào | arrive; reach; attain | llegar; alcanzar; hasta | 刂 | knife / sword | 至 (zhì / bird swooping down to earth / reaching) | 刂 (knife carving boundaries) | 8 | 左右结构 | Phono-semantic compound: 至 (reaching the destination) + 刂 (decisive arrival/carving), expressing arrival or successful attainment as a resultative verb complement. | An arrow or bird descending to touch earth (至) carved with certainty (刂). | Un ave que desciende hasta tocar tierra (至), marcando el arribo certero (刂). | 51 | MGIN | ""

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: When what you seek is acquired into your hands (得) and arrives fully in your possession (到), you have obtained it (得到).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Cuando lo que buscas cae en tus manos (得) y arriba a su destino final (到), lo has obtenido por completo (得到).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: The compound combines the acquisition verb 得 with the resultative attainment complement 到, creating a classic Chinese grammatical resultative construction.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: Rising 2nd tone followed by falling 4th tone or neutral tone: dé dào (35-51) or dé dao (35-0). In fast connected speech, 'dao' is often destressed.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    待 | dài | wait; treat | Has 寺 on the right instead of 㝵
    特 | tè | special | Has 牛 (ox) on the left of 寺
    倒 | dǎo / dào | fall; pour; invert | Has 亻 (person) on the left instead of 至
    致 | zhì | send; cause; fine | Has 夂 (walk) on the right of 至 instead of 刂
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    得分 | dé fēn | score points
    懂得 | dǒng de | understand; know
    到达 | dào dá | arrive at; reach
    到底 | dào dǐ | to the end; in the end

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 得到 marks the successful acquisition or receipt of tangible benefits, intangible approval, or results.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 得到 vs. 获得 | huòdé | 得到 is common in both spoken and written registers and pairs widely with passive verbs, whereas 获得 is more formal, usually pairing with achievements, prizes, or rights.
    2 | 得到 vs. 受到 | shòudào | 得到 stresses receiving something beneficial or objective, whereas 受到 stresses undergoing external influence or passive experience, including negative impacts.
    3 | 得到 vs. 取得 | qǔdé | 得到 emphasizes the passive or natural reception of something, whereas 取得 emphasizes proactive struggle and intentional effort to capture results.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 子路在富家做工不仅得到了应得的报酬，更得到了主人的敬重与赞许。然而在他看来，能够早日让家中的父母得到温饱，才是他付出所有汗水换来的最大回报。 | Zǐlù zài fùjiā zuògōng bùjǐn dédào le yīngdé de bàochou, gèng dédào le zhǔrén de jìngzhòng yǔ zànxǔ. Rán'ér zài tā kànlái, nénggòu zǎorì ràng jiāzhōng de fùmǔ dédào wēnbǎo, cái shì tā fùchū suǒyǒu hànshuǐ huànlái de zuì dà huíbào. | Working in the wealthy household, Zilu received not only fair wages, but also the master's respect. Yet to him, bringing food to warm his parents was the greatest reward for all his sweat. | Trabajando en la hacienda, Zilu no solo obtuvo su merecido sueldo, sino la estima del patrón. Mas para él, lograr que sus padres tuvieran pan fue la mayor recompensa a sus desvelos.
  #2 | 在现代企业管理学中，员工内心的成就感与归属感，往往需要在组织中得到充分的尊重与肯定。唯有当劳动者的辛勤付出能够得到公平合理的回报与制度保障时，整个团队才能凝聚起强大的向心力与创新活力。 | Zài xiàndài qǐyè guǎnlǐxué zhōng, yuángōng nèixīn de chéngjiùgǎn yǔ guīshǔgǎn, wǎngwǎng xūyào zài zǔzhī zhōng dédào chōngfèn de zūnzhòng yǔ kěndìng. Wéiyǒu dāng láodòngzhě de xīnqín fùchū nénggòu dédào gōngpíng hélǐ de huíbào yǔ zhìdù bǎozhàng shí, zhěnggè tuánduì cáinéng níngjù qǐ qiángdà de xiàngxīnlì yǔ chuàngxīn huólì. | In modern organizational management, employees' sense of accomplishment requires ample respect and affirmation. Only when laborers' earnest toil receives fair remuneration and institutional guarantees can a team maintain cohesion and innovative vitality. | En la gestión empresarial moderna, la motivación del personal requiere respeto y reconocimiento. Solo cuando el esfuerzo de los trabajadores obtiene una compensación justa y garantías institucionales, el equipo consolida su cohesión y empuje innovador.
